WEBVTT

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:32.190
Should be ready.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.650
Finally!

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.980
Time to chow down!

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.970
Too hot!

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:41.640
You moron, let it cool a minute.

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.780
Only one option here.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.000
Rasengan Mini!

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:53.980
That ought to do it.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:10.520
<b>The No-Ninjutsu Lifestyle!</b>

00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:16.430
I feel like lately the two of them have...

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:19.860
...been using their ninjutsu 
for very trivial reasons...

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:24.540
What should I do about it?

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.040
Guy?

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.540
What should I do, indeed?

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.570
Something wrong, Guy?

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.040
No, no...

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.880
Nothing to worry about.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:41.120
If it's nothing to worry about,
go wash the curry off your face.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.720
Actually, Lee...

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.390
That curry will stain!

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:54.110
Leaf Great Whirlwind!

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:58.990
I didn't train him so he could 
use his moves like that.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.510
Seriously, clean your face.

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:04.340
Though I must admit his 
hard work is paying off,

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.580
Lee's moves are looking sharp lately.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.630
Guy, your face is completely 
covered in curry.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.640
Still!

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:15.810
I feel as though he's taking 
his abilities for granted.

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:20.860
He's out there using his strength as
a ninja for the most trivial tasks!

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.430
The words of an old man who reeks
of curry don't carry much weight.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.070
Did you just say I've 
got old man stink?!

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.600
Enough already!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.760
I can sympathize. I was just 
thinking the same thing.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.270
You were?

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.890
I'd like to teach them a little
appreciation for their ninja skills.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.070
We'll just have to be blunt.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.240
Tell them they can't become elite
shinobi or the Hokage like that.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.530
But they're not kids anymore,

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:55.130
it'll take more than a 
pep talk to hook them.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.460
Hook?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:59.710
That's brilliant!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.420
What?

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.390
Leave everything to me!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.310
Real world experience?

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.940
Think of it like a social studies class.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.430
Sounds interesting!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.020
Why us, though?

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.150
I don't see Guy Sensei, either.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.130
Well, he...

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.770
Guy had something come up,

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.620
so he asked me to chaperon you, as well.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.830
Where are we going?

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:30.790
Um...

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:35.830
We'll make them do hard labor 
without using their techniques.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.750
That'll teach them to appreciate 
having such powerful ninja skills.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.840
You think they'll bite? Them?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.690
Oh, they'll bite.

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.080
Because they'll be fishing.

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.040
Fishing?

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.470
To a fisherman's boat.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:57.280
Experiencing some good, 
hard work will teach you a lot.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.190
Are you kidding me? How troublesome...

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:01.820
Oh, don't say that.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.450
Sensei!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.150
Can we bring a banana for a snack?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.860
Sensei, can we have cup ramen for lunch?

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.190
Sensei, can we try the local food?

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.370
You guys only think about food...

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:24.040
<i>Guy said to leave everything to him,
but I wonder if he'll actually show...</i>

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.780
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.940
Ah, you're here.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.410
<i>Yup, it's Guy.</i>

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.870
<i>This is no good. 
They'll see right through him.</i>

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.690
Hey, what's going on, Kakashi Sensei?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.710
He's no fisherman!

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:48.140
It's so obvious, even to us!

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:49.660
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:53.410
With that punch, he must 
be an ex-baseball player!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.250
Punching means he's a boxer!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.250
Ding ding ding!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.990
He's got an afro.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:02.670
Punches aside, he must be a famous
 Japanese ballad singer.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.800
Can we have your autograph?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.510
Don't ask him for that!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:10.220
<i>Thank god, they can't tell...</i>

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.750
Thanks for having us!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.430
One thing before we start.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.400
No one's allowed to use ninja 
techniques on my ship!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:22.400
<i>Yes. If this works...</i>

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.610
Man, this is tough.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.090
Not even a nibble.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.450
This is impossible without ninjutsu.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:31.860
See?

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:36.260
Now do you realize how lucky you
are to be able to use it at all?

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.210
From now on, make sure you use 
ninjutsu more responsibly!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.580
Kakashi Sensei!

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.610
Why can't we use ninja techniques?

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.430
It's not fair!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.220
Well, you see...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.480
All right, all right.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.800
I'll tell you.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.650
I was just sixteen years old...

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:57.770
Huh?

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:03.160
I was a juvenile delinquent with a 
 bit of a rep in this harbor town.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.000
Sup?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>What kinda origin story is this?</i>

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:08.990
<i>And who is that?</i>

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:14.300
I thought, "I wanna get out 
of this one-boat hole."

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:18.380
But my dad wanted me to take 
over the family business.

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.930
We had a big fight, and I ran away.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.990
<i>We don't need to know what 
happened before you left.</i>

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.460
So, five years later, it's spring, 
and I'm living in the capital.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:34.350
I was living paycheck to paycheck 
with no real goal in life.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.240
Then one night,

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:40.520
I ate the most delicious 
boiled squid I'd ever had,

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.180
and it stirred my heart.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.490
Then I noticed something.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:46.610
Everyone in the diner was eating the
same thing, and they all looked so happy.

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.250
I finally got it.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:52.940
I thought he was just a two-bit 
fisherman, but my dad...

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.670
He was accomplishing something big,

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.460
making so many people happy 
by catching those fish.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.700
By the time I came back to town,

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:06.260
my dad had taken ill.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.900
Ever since, I've been on this boat,

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.500
catching fish and doing 
the great service...

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.830
...of bringing joy to others, 
just like my dad!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.500
That had nothing to do with ninjas.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:21.730
What happened to explaining 
why they can't use ninjutsu?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.810
That was beautiful!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.930
You're a great man!

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.400
I'm gonna start bawling...

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.360
It can be troublesome, being a guy...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.570
That boiled squid sounded so tasty...

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:40.360
We should all respect his wishes
and refrain from using our ninja skills.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:40.960
Yeah.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.170
Wait, what?

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.910
Am I supposed to make the jokes today?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.040
It's rocking a lot.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.350
Are we gonna be okay 
without our ninjutsu?

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:56.390
This is the perfect opportunity 
to learn your limits physically.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:01.500
Remember, the fisherman here does his
job every day without any ninja powers.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.850
Indeed!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:07.610
The first thing to focus on 
is getting used to the boat.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.580
Why don't you get used to it first?!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.850
It's okay. I can handle this.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:16.430
All right, folks, let's catch some fish!

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.160
The bait's right over there.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.480
Are you insane?! That's the bait!

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:23.790
But I'm hungry...

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.310
Yeah, I hear you.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.480
Being on a boat's a lot of work!

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.630
It's not bad.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.040
Not you guys, too?!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:32.960
Hey!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.260
Stop fooling around on my boat!

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:39.200
Maybe if you weren't 
setting a bad example.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:39.920
Tee hee hee.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.140
Don't "tee hee hee" me!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.650
Now we've got no bait left.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.640
Never fear.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.270
We've got bait costumes.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.810
What good will it do us 
if you're the bait?!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.150
Ah ha, so we still have that option.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.570
What are you gonna catch with that?!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>I</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>D</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>O</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>L</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>C</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>O</b>

00:09:56.750 --> 00:10:00.030
<b>N</b>

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:00.150
I was thinking we'd land 
some of those fangirls...

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.400
...who are into younger guys 
who look kinda tough.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.500
It's true that girls are 
into that look these days.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.040
What?!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.230
Girls of every generation like a guy
who's not afraid to show some skin!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.580
Right, Sakura?

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.150
Actually,

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:17.410
I think that girls prefer 
a guy with muscles.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.330
Right, Sakura?

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.460
Not that again!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:20.390
Wrong!

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.600
Women prefer a man in 
medieval underwear—

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:25.240
No one prefers that!

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.870
We caught a ton of fish!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.090
It's so much easier with ninjutsu.

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:54.380
We didn't have a choice. We had no bait.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:58.630
I guess it's hopeless...

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.290
What the...

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.580
Whoa, what is this thing?

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.330
Boiled squid!

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.250
Cooked squid!

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:11.630
Ink-redible dried squid!

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:12.940
You're all wrong!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.510
Can't you people think about 
anything besides food?!

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.870
We've gotta calm it down.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.640
The boat's rocking too much 
for us to use ninjutsu!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.370
This is getting troublesome!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.360
We're just gonna have to pound it.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.590
I'm in.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.600
I guess we're stuck...

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:38.550
Wait!

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:44.890
I told you, no ninjutsu on my ship!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.100
Guy Sensei?!

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.020
Watch closely!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:54.770
He's nuts.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:01.200
Shrimp Tossing High Jump
Tornado Punch!

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.790
Guy Sensei!

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:11.000
Guy?

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:16.830
Guy Sensei?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.330
What are you?

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.340
You're ninjas!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:24.110
And you shouldn't abuse your powers
as ninjas to accomplish trivial tasks!

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:27.140
To truly be a strong shinobi,

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.470
you must only use your abilities to 
accomplish big, important things!

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.430
Understand?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.140
Yes!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:41.990
Too hot!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.320
We gotta cool it off.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.990
Well, I guess we're back to square one.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.350
No, Sakura.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:53.190
Ninja mustn't use their 
powers for small things.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:53.790
We...

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:58.440
...must only use them for 
big, important tasks!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.170
Exactly.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.510
That's not what he meant by "big."

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:10.150
Thus, Naruto and Lee aim to accomplish
bigger things using their ninja abilities.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:06.500
Giant Rasengan!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:16.020
Crack

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:16.020
I guess it's not that bad an ending.

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:31.910
Sakura!

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.130
Lee!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.160
Waiting for the rain to stop?

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:37.280
Unfortunately.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.630
You don't have an umbrella either?

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.840
This is just another form of training!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.440
I see...

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:46.210
Naruto!

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:47.630
Let me get under your umbrella.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.720
Bye, Lee!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.590
Thanks, I really appreciate it.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:53.890
Anything for you!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.070
I'll walk you home.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:07.910
<b>I Want to Share an Umbrella with Sakura</b>

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.280
What is it, Tenten?

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:15.200
Is that...

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.650
Maybe that pattern's better.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:20.970
What's better?

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.900
This floral print one...

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:29.130
Don't scare me like that.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.990
Right back at you!

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.270
What are you up to?

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:36.230
I, um...

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:39.580
What's wrong? You're acting weird.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.900
I see.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:50.360
You're upset because you missed a chance
to snuggle with Sakura under an umbrella.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:54.360
Don't worry about not having 
an umbrella this time.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.330
It's the rainy season.
 You'll have plenty of opportunities.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.200
That's not the problem.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.750
Guy Sensei gave Lee a 
little assignment...

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.250
Listen, Lee.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:08.260
You can never tell when it might 
rain or get windy during battle.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:11.030
So to prepare yourself to 
deal with adverse weather,

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.590
I'm scared!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.690
Don't stare!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.590
don't use any umbrellas!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.560
Understood, Guy Sensei!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.940
Remember, going without 
an umbrella is training!

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:23.690
Let's roll!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:31.380
Forget training.
 You guys are just goofing off!

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.660
I could never ignore 
Guy Sensei's teachings.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.000
Still, I...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.670
I want to smuggle with 
Sakura under an umbrella.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.740
Smuggle?

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.370
It's "snuggle."

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.970
If you're that upset,
why not talk to Guy Sensei?

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.200
He'd probably let the umbrella thing slide.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.550
You think?

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:58.350
Well, he didn't tell 
us not to carry them.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.640
Besides, Guy Sensei's not heartless.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.730
You're right.

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.690
You fool!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.660
If you were an ordinary ninja,

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.160
I'd have no problem with
you carrying an umbrella.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:19.540
But, Lee, you cannot use ninjutsu.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.460
If you want to become an elite ninja,

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.570
you have to turn ordinary everyday 
activities into training!

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:27.380
And if you can't understand that, 
then you're hopeless!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.380
I'm sorry...

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.520
Look how sad he is.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:44.480
We screwed up, huh?

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:48.960
If you ask me, Guy Sensei's 
being way too strict.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.450
Training is one thing—

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.990
Training, that's it!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:54.700
Training?

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.640
Yeah!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:58.530
If we can turn carrying an 
umbrella into training somehow,

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.020
Sensei shouldn't have any objections!

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:02.040
Makes sense.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.750
So cheer up, okay?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.180
We'll start umbrella training right now!

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:09.250
I guess I'll help out, too.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.380
Congratulations!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.050
No!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:21.450
Look, this is the only kind of umbrella
related training I could think of.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.270
You're not on Broadway!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.210
And you're not even using 
the umbrella, Lee!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:26.770
Then...

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.900
<b>Quiet</b>

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.230
Cha-

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.730
Shu-

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.450
Men!

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.780
No golfing on the train platform!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.050
Get serious, would you?

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.620
I was serious...

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.620
I just can't think of a good 
way to train with an umbrella.

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.800
Fine, fine.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:48.580
How about this?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.470
A weighted umbrella.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:57.300
Holding this thing with one hand is
training no matter how you slice it.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.670
No, no, no, no, no!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.970
That's easy for you to say, Tenten,

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.760
but this is impossible!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.200
Quit griping!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:04.610
Pick it up!

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:10.610
Heavy...

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.480
Neji, catch...

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.940
Why me...

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:21.190
It's... too heavy...

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.590
Stop whining!

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.540
Hard work is your trademark!

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:28.960
Hard work is my... trademark?

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.850
Understood! I'll do my best!

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.180
He's finally back to normal.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:39.970
And so the three teammates
began a harsh training regimen.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.310
Hey, you're wobbling!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:44.980
If you can't walk straight,
Sakura will get soaked!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:45.800
Right...

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.580
C'mon, c'mon!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.940
Be glad it's not a capital t!

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.770
Again!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.800
When you get to the top,
you've got two more rounds!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.120
Nice, you've gotten pretty 
good at holding it up.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.180
No more. Catch.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.950
Why... Why me?

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:12.290
Sakura, would you like to walk with me?

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.290
That voice... Lee?

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:17.130
Heavy...

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:21.010
You can't ask her with
that face! It's terrifying!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:23.340
You didn't have to smash me...

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:26.470
Tenten, you're overdoing it.

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:29.220
Fine. I'll do it.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:33.230
Sakura, would you like to walk with me?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:34.980
That voice... Lee?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:38.170
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.200
You finished him off!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.840
You should get under my umbrella.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.260
More polite!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:44.670
Walk in my umbrella.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.460
Too pushy and weird grammar!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.080
Shall we go into my umbrella?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.660
Seriously, your grammar's messed up!

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:53.400
You did it!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.840
You're holding that heavy 
umbrella like it's nothing.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.030
And your invitation is 
really smooth now, too.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:03.390
Lee, what's wrong?

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.100
Tenten, Neji...

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:07.910
Thank you...

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:11.270
...for doing all this for me!

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:12.940
Lee...

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.520
Are you crying?

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.200
No way.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:19.100
I've just got a little mucus 
coming out of my eyes.

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.450
You could've said sweat, you know.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.180
Pretend I did.

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:26.740
You'd better not look this 
pathetic for Sakura tomorrow.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.040
I won't! I'll do my best!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:50.710
Man when the rainy season 
ends, it ends quick.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.940
Thank goodness for high pressure!

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.290
Let's go to the beach!

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:14.670
Excuse me.

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:19.290
May we share your umbrella?

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:22.340
The sun's very strong today. 
It's really bright out.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.350
If you insist.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:36.560
This isn't a three person 
umbrella, it's a bit cramped.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.980
No complaining.

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:24.090
It was summer, all those years ago.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:27.170
I wanted to become a ninja,
even though I can't use ninjutsu,

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.680
and Guy Sensei took me under his 
wing without a second thought.

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:35.180
Now, Guy Sensei, the time has
come for me to overtake you!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:39.600
Next time on Rock Lee 
and His Ninja Pals,

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:42.920
"Student vs. Master! 
Rock Lee vs. Might Guy!"

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:45.570
<b>Student vs. Master! Rock Lee vs. Might Guy!
I will Surpass Guy Sensei!</b>

00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:45.570
And "I will Surpass Guy-Sensei!"

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.440
I can beat you, Guy Sensei! Just wait!
